## How This Differs From a Public Liquity Deployment

| Aspect | Public Liquity | Your Internal CDP |
|--------|----------------|-------------------|
| **Collateral** | ETH only | PAXG + XAUt (gold) |
| **Users** | Anyone | Only treasury (via admin) |
| **LTV** | 110% MCR (risky) | 25% max LTV, 400% min ratio (ultra-safe) |
| **Stability Pool** | External depositors | None (treasury manages risk) |
| **LQTY token** | Yes (incentives) | No |
| **Admin controls** | None (immutable) | Full admin (pause, adjust params) |
| **Purpose** | Public borrowing | Treasury capital efficiency |

